    "title": "Glide Popper 22cm - 110g",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">22 cm and 110 g of weight. It is a small mouth popper that you can retrieve with the rod high like a pencil with repeated splashes but if necessary with traditional popping action It make a deep sound and its length makes it very stable with wave and wind.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Its length makes it very stable with wave and wind. Weight and size are optimal for making many casts effortlessly despite having a very visible size and looking for tuna or even large gt.</p>",
